    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d377">

                <pb facs="0570" n="284" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg284"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 300.115/9561</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Austria-Hungary</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Penfield</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 1811</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-07-24">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 24, 1916</hi>
                        </date>.<lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received August 21</hi>.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to the Department’s telegraphic
                    instruction No. 1296<anchor n="1" xml:id="d377-f1"/> of the 14th instant, and to
                    my telegram No. 1349<anchor n="2" xml:id="d377-f2"/> of the 22d instant,
                    relative to the extension of the time set for the registration of claims in the
                    prize proceedings in the case of the S. S. <hi rendition="#italic">Ancona</hi>,
                    I have the honor to transmit herewith a copy of a communication from the
                    Imperial and Royal Ministry of Foreign Affairs in this connection on which my
                    telegram above referred to was based.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Frederic C. Penfield</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d377-a1.xml" xpointer="d377-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
